# Test index for EntityMetaRegistry.loadIndex() — exercises the
# ClassLoader.getResources + Class.forName + entityMeta() reflection path.
# One FQCN per line; comments and blank lines are skipped by the loader.
#
# The two broken entries below deliberately drive the registry's defensive
# branches: NonExistentMeta triggers Class.forName failure (catch block),
# and BadEntityMeta.entityMeta() returns a non-EntityMeta value
# (instanceof false branch). Neither should prevent IndexedEntityMeta from
# registering successfully.
com.holo.framework.horm.core.IndexedEntityMeta
com.holo.framework.horm.core.NonExistentMeta
com.holo.framework.horm.core.BadEntityMeta
